        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Connector colours&lt;/b&gt; — official AWS category palette&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#DD344C&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Auth and encryption&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#7AA116&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Skill storage&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#ED7100&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Compute&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#01A88D&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Model&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#8C4FFF&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Networking and egress&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#E7157B&quot;&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; Observability&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#AAB7B8&quot;&gt;╌╌&lt;/font&gt; Reference or routing only&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Icon families:&lt;/b&gt; coloured tiles are AWS &lt;i&gt;service&lt;/i&gt; icons; flat glyphs are &lt;i&gt;resource&lt;/i&gt; icons — VPC endpoints, NAT, users.&lt;br&gt;Dashed lines carry no request traffic of their own; they say &quot;this governs that&quot;." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F7F7;strokeColor=#AAB7B8;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="990" width="680" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;What the picture is claiming&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; The browser holds &lt;b&gt;one&lt;/b&gt; IAM permission: lambda:InvokeFunction on the proxy. It has no S3 permission at all, so there is no arrow from the developer to the bucket.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;shared/&lt;/b&gt; is reachable by the harness and by Terraform, never by the browser. A user observes it only through the agent&#39;s behaviour.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; &lt;b&gt;shell is excluded&lt;/b&gt; from allowed_tools: a skill that can shell out could read shared/ and exfiltrate it.&lt;br&gt;&amp;#8226; The module creates no VPC, subnets, NAT or route tables — those stay with whoever owns the account." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E7;strokeColor=#ED7100;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="890" y="990" width="630" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
